{
  "$description": "One name per thing, in both locales (SPEC 11.2, BUI-F8). The single source for game modes, play surfaces, ammunition, hit outcomes, crew roles and modules: tools/glossary-sync.mjs writes each term into every catalog key bound to it and its --check (src/ui/glossary.selftest.mjs, core suite) fails when a catalog drifts. A term binds keys three ways: `keys` take the term in both locales; `upper` take it in capitals in en-US (older HUD and Studio labels whose caps predate the CSS-only caps rule) and as written in zh-CN; `zh` bind only the zh-CN text (the en-US copy is a deliberately different form, such as a shorter HUD label). A `short` form is the one name for slots too narrow for the full one (48-64 px), with its own binding lists. `retired` names may not appear anywhere in that locale's catalog.",
